      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's just something people say to make it feel better, but it's not true. it's not an \"echo\" or a \"feeling.\" it's actually happening. people look right through me. i try to explain things or join in and it's like i'm a glitch in the system. like i've already been deleted. it's not a feeling, it's just my life now. there's no way to fix it.",
